1
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:24,080
This is City Traffic Radio.

2
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:25,800
Welcome, listeners.

3
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,600
We are now broadcasting
real-time traffic conditions.

4
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:31,360
Why do we have to go so far
for our anniversary?

5
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:34,660
Are you live-streaming
while driving a ride-hailing car?

6
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,980
It's just a companion stream.
I don't interact.

7
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:40,770
Why make yourself so tired?

8
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,920
What are you good for?

9
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:43,980
Driving so slowly.

10
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:44,930
Mr. Chen,

11
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:46,200
I don't know what's going on.

12
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:47,720
The speed just won't go over 100.

13
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:50,080
Now for a weather update.

14
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:53,480
In the next three days,
some areas will experience...

15
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:03,040
This...

16
00:01:05,319 --> 00:01:06,560
You brainless idiot,

17
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:08,090
do you know how to drive?

18
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:13,440
Your car broke down too?

19
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:14,520
What's going on?

20
00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:47,280
Quick, go to that bus ahead.

21
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:51,720
Get out of my way.

22
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:52,780
Let me get on first.

23
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:10,240
Stop looking.

24
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,500
Let's sit in the front.

25
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,880
Welcome to the Master God Bus.

26
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:53,000
Current stop: Nether Mortuary.

27
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:53,920
Clearance rules:

28
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,480
1. Survive until dawn.

29
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:58,760
2. Find and burn
the extremely Yin object of this station.

30
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:00,320
Those who fail
before the countdown ends...

31
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:01,440
Who was talking just now?

32
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:02,680
You heard it too, right?

33
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,920
It's not my hallucination.

34
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:05,450
What the hell is this place?

35
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:07,880
Lin Xiaofei, call for rescue immediately.

36
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:10,010
B-Boss, there's no signal.

37
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:12,640
Ghost!

38
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,490
What is this ugly thing?

39
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:28,400
Now you know why I warned you.

40
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:30,760
It's not human.

41
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,360
What is this?

42
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,680
I don't know. Looks like a zombie.

43
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:37,120
Like a system,

44
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:39,000
or a game.

45
00:03:39,079 --> 00:03:40,010
These monsters,

46
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:42,000
the whole world belongs to him.

47
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,800
Look at your skinny arms and legs.

48
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:49,880
Why don't you follow me?

49
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:51,360
I've trained before.

50
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:05,120
Killed a low-level walking corpse.

51
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,240
EXP +10.

52
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:08,650
This game experience is quite realistic.

53
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:12,720
We're even. I don't like owing people.

54
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,120
You hit pretty hard.

55
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:15,920
Let's get to know each other.

56
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:16,920
I'm Liu Yiyang.

57
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,450
Xiao Han, forensic doctor.

58
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:22,079
Don't expect me to thank you.

59
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,000
Don't just stand there.

60
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,080
Anyone who can move, get moving.

61
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:48,240
Block the windows.

62
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,600
These things eat people.

63
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,600
Staying in the car is waiting to die.

64
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:55,800
What are you still standing there for?

65
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,159
Go get that box.

66
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:01,880
Xiao Han, don't just stand there.

67
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:02,720
Come help.

68
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,440
They are scratching.

69
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:06,360
What did you say?

70
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,520
Look at their claws.

71
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,720
Although they are attacking,

72
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,080
with their numbers, if they really rammed,

73
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:11,440
this car would have collapsed long ago.

74
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:12,900
They are just scratching,

75
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:16,200
not ramming.

76
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,720
They are slow.

77
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,640
The car won't hold.

78
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:23,880
Everyone get behind me.

79
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:24,680
They move slowly.

80
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:26,210
We can outrun them if we run.

81
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,440
That house is covered in talismans.

82
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:11,700
It might be a safe zone.

83
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:12,520
As long as we can get there,

84
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:13,480
there's still hope.

85
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:15,280
But it's swarming with these monsters.

86
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:16,440
How do we get across?

87
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:25,160
Novice entry procedure complete.

88
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:27,650
Distributing initial blind box weapons.

89
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,800
What is this junk?

90
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,760
I'm worth tens of millions,

91
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:38,480
and you give me a megaphone?

92
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,200
Am I supposed to swear
the zombies to death?

93
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,400
What is this junk?

94
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:42,930
I'm worth tens of millions.

95
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,120
D-Do you know how to use that?

96
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,280
Don't push yourself.

97
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:52,940
I was on my college Sanda team.

98
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:57,060
Hide behind me and call me sis.

99
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,080
Don't be afraid, honey.

100
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:02,960
This is just like the wrench
I use for gas pipes.

101
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:04,280
Whoever comes near,
I'll twist their head off.

102
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:05,080
Honey,

103
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:08,120
didn't you say you'd take me on a trip
after this busy period?

104
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:09,240
I will. I definitely will once I'm done.

105
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,900
Why doesn't she have a weapon?

106
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,520
It really is a safe zone. Hurry!

107
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:35,960
Don't get in the way. Hurry!

108
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:47,720
Bolt the door!

109
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:03,440
W-What the hell is this place?

110
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:09,120
Honey, why are your hands so cold?

111
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:12,000
Don't be afraid.
We're safe inside. I'm here.

112
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:15,440
A c-coffin? Why is there a coffin here?

113
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:22,600
The late Master Ren.

114
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:26,400
Resting unburied,

115
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:29,050
awaiting joint burial with his late wife.

116
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:32,640
The guy lying in this coffin

117
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:34,370
should be worth a lot of points.

118
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:35,720
At a time like this,

119
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:37,120
you're still thinking about your points?

120
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,039
If we can't find the item of extreme Yin,

121
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:39,200
we might all die.

122
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,240
Master Ren inside

123
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:42,520
should be the item of extreme Yin.
According to the setting,

124
00:08:42,520 --> 00:08:43,919
he'll break out of the coffin tonight.

125
00:08:43,919 --> 00:08:47,650
You've read too many tomb-raiding novels.
Break out of the coffin?

126
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:49,620
Then we'll fight him to the death.

127
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,300
If we fight head-on

128
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:53,960
with our current strength,

129
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,690
we'll definitely be wiped out.

130
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:58,800
We must find something
to seal this coffin tight.
